# Illidan's air Immolate, roundhouse kick forward smash and Flames of Azzinoth, each
# hitting b. Illidan a against Illidan b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero illidan
# Both dash in and pass each other, b ending about 50 behind a.
40 b stick -1 0
48 b stick 0 0
50 a stick 1 0
58 a stick 0 0
# Air Immolate: jump, then down special in the air.
80 a tap B 8
92 a stick 0 -1
92 a tap X 2
93 a stick 0 0
# Roundhouse kick (forward smash).
260 a stick 1 0
260 a press LB
264 a stick 0 0
264 a release LB
# Flames of Azzinoth (down smash).
440 a stick 0 -1
440 a press LB
444 a stick 0 0
444 a release LB
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script):
#! expect a 92 special 12 form 0
#! expect a 260 applied attack 1 style 4
#! expect a 440 applied attack 2 style 3
#! scene a ImmolationTarget
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
